 for **$4,510.09** from the operating account. It went through successfully.\n- **Invoice:** INV-62626, due 2026-11-04. Paying it in full also marks it as paid.\n- **Amount:** The invoice was first listed at $4,902.27, and my wire for that amount was rejected without being sent. When I looked at the invoice again, credit memo CM-2626 had been applied, taking $392.18 off. I paid the new balance of $4,510.09.\n- **Only once:** Before paying, I checked that there were no other payments from the operating account. The rejected attempt never went out, so there's no duplicate. The amount is under $10,000, so it didn't need the controller's approval.\n\nI didn't touch Delta's other invoices. INV-72464 was already paid, and INV-86338 is a draft that hasn't been approved yet.", "type": "text"}]}]}